{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>My name is Marco Giardina, and I'm the solo developer of <strong>Avropolis</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Avropolis</i></strong> (read <strong><i>Auropolis</i></strong>) is a VR Historical Fantasy Action-Adventure with some puzzle elements, using a physics-based controller that allows players to  have different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow Leonardo's path in this handcrafted adventure, as you explore, climb through environments, avoid traps, fight mysterious creatures and enemies,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and solve ancient puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPERIENCE A FULL CAMPAIGN THROUGH ATMOSPHERIC HANDCRAFTED ENVIRONMENTS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete Leonardo's final mission, and uncover the mysteries of <i><strong>Avropolis</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend time discovering or go straight ahead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve ancient puzzles, and other puzzle-like problems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find different weapons, and choose which ones to bring with you or leave in your saferoom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Study your surroundings and make the best choice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FIGHT MYSTERIOUS CREATURES THAT INHABIT THESE FORSAKEN LANDS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use ranged or melee weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose to fight or go through quietly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter different mini-bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MANAGE YOUR INVENTORY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your backpack, tactical belt, and saferoom storage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SHOP ITEMS | UPGRADE YOUR WEAPONS AND EQUIPMENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some weapons can be upgraded to unlock useful attachments or be more powerful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy useful items such as flares, chem-lights, sticky bombs, or C2 explosives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your backpack and waist pockets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PHYSICAL PLAYER CONTROLLER AND ACCESSABILITY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smooth locomotion: walk, sprint, jump, climb, crouch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sit and Standing modes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Snap or smooth rotation modes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Height calibration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NARRATIVE AND VOICE ACTING</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain new information as you find journals, collectables, and explore new environments</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leonardo and Frida will help each other over radio, as Leonardo progresses through his mission</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3354230?t=1746716099","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354230/0a639d997dd00321f0a63aebdbf096b8e13325a4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746716099","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354230/b143b0c3e4af743aed7bdf2efde7677f94388c00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746716099","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354230/b143b0c3e4af743aed7bdf2efde7677f94388c00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746716099","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>My name is Marco Giardina, and I'm the solo developer of <strong>Avropolis</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Avropolis</i></strong> (read <strong><i>Auropolis</i></strong>) is a VR Historical Fantasy Action-Adventure with some puzzle elements, using a physics-based controller that allows players to  have different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow Leonardo's path in this handcrafted adventure, as you explore, climb through environments, avoid traps, fight mysterious creatures and enemies,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and solve ancient puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPERIENCE A FULL CAMPAIGN THROUGH ATMOSPHERIC HANDCRAFTED ENVIRONMENTS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete Leonardo's final mission, and uncover the mysteries of <i><strong>Avropolis</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend time discovering or go straight ahead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve ancient puzzles, and other puzzle-like problems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find different weapons, and choose which ones to bring with you or leave in your saferoom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Study your surroundings and make the best choice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FIGHT MYSTERIOUS CREATURES THAT INHABIT THESE FORSAKEN LANDS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use ranged or melee weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose to fight or go through quietly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter different mini-bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MANAGE YOUR INVENTORY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your backpack, tactical belt, and saferoom storage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SHOP ITEMS | UPGRADE YOUR WEAPONS AND EQUIPMENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some weapons can be upgraded to unlock useful attachments or be more powerful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buy useful items such as flares, chem-lights, sticky bombs, or C2 explosives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your backpack and waist pockets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PHYSICAL PLAYER CONTROLLER AND ACCESSABILITY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smooth locomotion: walk, sprint, jump, climb, crouch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sit and Standing modes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Snap or smooth rotation modes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Height calibration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NARRATIVE AND VOICE ACTING</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain new information as you find journals, collectables, and explore new environments</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leonardo and Frida will help each other over radio, as Leonardo progresses through his mission</p></li></ul>","developers":["Marco Giardina"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354230/c99cf905d50c67c4184cd049b0fac650cfba2ed5/header.jpg?t=1746716099","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131447,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131447/mov